  SuitSprite: {fileID: 0}
  CardStory: "Spades2 comes in for debrief this morning, and he gets the feeling
    that the Sergeant is off.\r\nMaybe the stress. She sits under the table, I think.
    I see her eyes there. \r\n\r\nSpades2 feels like not everyone is genuine in their
    reports, and lets her know. A lot of accusations towards superiors and rivals.
    Getting competition out of the way. \r\n\r\nThe Sergeant thanks me for his report.
    Spades2 sees her reflection on the polished wood.\r\n\r\nHave her eyes always
    been this big?\r\n\r\nOf course, I think. Why wouldn\u2019t they? I\u2019ve heard
    it say that she\u2019s got an eye for the battlefield. Spades2 shakes his head
    and reel for a moment. Ah, that must be it, Spades2 thinks. An eye for the battlefield.
    Right on. I must be getting forgetful again.\r\n\r\nCaptain Jack smiles.\r\n\r\nSpades2
    smiles. I smile."
